y that we're going to  accept the recommendations of a review  that we will  put in place highly protected marine  areas this is where you would prevent  any activity there whether it's  extraction such as fishing or aggregates  or indeed even wind wind farms in order  to enable these areas to  fully recover and there are a lot of  benefits for the environment in doing  that so we're going to  pilot some of those sites okay well do  ocean day how are you going to celebrate  it  uh well i should be doing it's very  close to our heart here at sky we love  the oceans as you know we have  massive campaigns today we do and i  think the public are very concerned  about  plastics in our nations i'm very  concerned about some of those uh  threats to marine life and indeed  overfishing and it's one of the big  issues actually that'll be on g7  indeed you you're going down there this  week i should be going down on wednesday  night uh  it's happening just across sometimes bay  my constituencies at the other side of  that  i've got a number of events that i'll be  attending fantastic it's good to talk to  you thank you so much for taking the  time to join us this morning
 

